# Glorious Anthem: "Creatures you control get +1/+1." A static ability (CR 604.1, 613.4c) that reaches every creature its
# controller controls, one that enters later too (CR 611.3a): Bot1's Llanowar Elves, cast after it on turn 1, is a 2/2,
# and Bot2's Llanowar Elves, which Bot1 does not control, stays a 1/1. The Anthem itself is no creature.

